## 5 New Feature Upgrades

| # | Feature | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Smart Email Triage** | Emails categorized by urgency (🔴🟡🟢) instead of flat list |
| 2 | **Calendar-Aware Context** | Cross-references emails with calendar ("Prof. Smith emailed about your 2 PM meeting") |
| 3 | **Approval Flow** | Draft email → inline keyboard → approve/edit/reject → send |
| 4 | **Multi-theme PDF** | Professional slide templates (academic, minimal, modern) |
| 5 | **Audit Log** | Every AI action logged with timestamp, viewable via `/history` |

