## Verification Plan

### Automated
- `python -c "from config import Config; print(Config())"` — config loads
- `python -c "from tools.ai_engine import AIEngine; print('ok')"` — no import crash
- `python main.py` — starts without errors, enters Telegram polling

### Manual
- Send test messages via Telegram and verify real routing
- Trigger PDF generation and verify file delivery
- Set a scheduled task and verify it fires + delivers results
